Epic Bard Epic Performance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:EpicClassFeature.Bard	VISIBLE:YES	DESC:Your performances transcend normal limits. Select a group of performances to enhance with a bonus from the associated list. Groups: Ally Enhancement (Inspire Courage/Competence/Greatness/Heroics), Enemy Affliction (Fascinate/Suggestion/Frightening Tune/Mass Suggestion/Deadly Performance), Soothing Performance.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH

